sparky-stereo-hardware (0.1.16) unstable; urgency=medium

  * No fallback to nouveau: when the edition's NVIDIA module is missing,
    its version names no NVIDIA version, the lock and the CUDA repository
    package cannot be installed, apt update fails or the preflight fails,
    the NVIDIA setup stops with an ERROR line saying what failed, why and
    what to do, purges what it installed, and the setup exits non-zero.
    Before, each case logged "FALLBACK ... nouveau firmware installed" and
    the setup reported success. ORDER 343.
  * nouveau on a supported NVIDIA card is the person's own choice: the plan
    window's button "Install matched support, keep nouveau", or
    --nvidia nouveau.
  * Every step says when it fails, and the run ends with the list of errors
    and exit status 1: package installs, the missing firmware, the
    power-profiles-daemon actions the machine does not offer (counted as
    done before), the wheel drivers, the OpenGL stereo default, and any
    unexpected failure with its line.
  * When the menu started the setup, the list of errors opens in a window,
    each error in the person's language: the error messages are numbered
    strings (LOCAL29 to LOCAL54) in the nine language files, and the log
    keeps every ERROR line in English for support. The plan window's own
    failure is said instead of being taken for Cancel.
  * An unexpected failure inside a step (set -E) is said with its line and
    command; set -e alone ended the setup there without a word.
  * Recommends sparky-stereo-cuda-repo, so an installed system takes the
    narrowed CUDA pin and the edition's dkms with an ordinary upgrade.
  * A CUDA repository the person set up is kept and named, and
    sparky-stereo-cuda-repo comes with the lock anyway: from 20261101.2 it
    writes no source of its own then, and its pins go by origin.
  * French: the plan window's button reads "Installer la prise en charge
    correspondante, garder nouveau".
  * The dry run says what would stop the NVIDIA setup; a loader that does
    not list its CPU levels is noted; the postinst says when the OpenGL
    stereo default could not be written; the plan says why an unsupported
    NVIDIA card keeps nouveau.
  * Supersedes 0.1.15, which was not published.

